        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43396"/>
        <updated>2026-03-10T14:31:22.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8505377?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">The MDN page for <code class="notranslate">Event.isTrusted</code> property suggests that the click event should always have the property set to false. This seems incorrect.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<p dir="auto">All of Blink, Gecko and WebKit fire clicks with regular <code class="notranslate">.isTrusted</code> values (trusted if and only if the event came from UA).</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<p dir="auto">Test page: <a href="https://codepen.io/editor/mustaqahmed/pen/019cd7f5-bed2-7130-9ef7-74821cee52d3" rel="nofollow">https://codepen.io/editor/mustaqahmed/pen/019cd7f5-bed2-7130-9ef7-74821cee52d3</a></p>
